My first ascension - isn't victory sweet!  I played Barbarian for the longest
time and then tried Valkyrie.  Mojo is great!

Karna the Valkyrie ascended into demigoddess-hood with the following stats:

Karna the Champion          St:25 Dx:15 Co:18 In:12 Wi:16 Ch:11  Neutral
Astral Plane $:0  HP:146(233) Pw:159(159) AC:-11 Exp:29 T:62520 Blind

 No  Points     Name                                                   Hp [max]
  1    3570432  Karna-V ascended to demigoddess-hood.                 146 [233]

Notable items in my possession:
Amulets - reflection, magical breathing (found in dungeon)
Weapon - +2 blessed rustproof Mjollnir (offered white unicorn to Odin)
Armor   - rustproof ydsm (made from scales with enchant armor)
        - rustproof +3 GoP (wish #2)
        - +1 blessed helm of brilliance (found in dungeon)
	- cloak of displacement (found in a shop)
Rings   - levitation, conflict
Scrolls - 3 blessed scrolls of genocide (wish #3) (used 2, no more Ls or Vs!)
Spellbooks - Remove curse (wish #4)
Wands   - Death, Wishing (castle), miscellaneous
Tools   - blessed PYEC (wish #1)

plus a couple of luckstones I found in the mines.  I passed up on some notables:
FrostBrand (from Odin), SunSword, Demonbane (Angels had this in the endgame),
SoR ( I had a +4 small shield).  And about $45K zorkmids in my BoH.

I got the best kick out of throwing Mojo and "it returns to your hands".  Way cool!

My AC was quite low (or should I say high?) (-11).  No donations to charity.

Final Attributes - telepathy, displacement, warning, the usual resistances - fire,
poison, cold, shock.

Wand of Death was quite convenient to dispatch WoY, Asmodeus, Orcus etc. with one
stroke.  Didn't want to kill poor Orcus, but he kept annoying me by standing in 
my way!

One thing confused me - why did Angels of Odin attack me in the Astral Plane?
Why would they want to do something like that?  Eventually I put on the RoC and
let them kill each other.  Came very close to dying there.  Phew!

I found a figurine of a cockatrice and got an interesting pet.  Kind of nice, really,
but the beast is too slow.  Corky disappeared (presumably down a trapdoor) and I
never found her again.

Had a few tough moments: finding stairs mainly.  I was too stupid to use crystal
balls until I saw some posts here.  And I had the Orb of Fate all the time!  But
for some reason I could do level-teleports?  Do I need teleport control to do
that?

Rust monsters and Puddings are a pain in the #$%!  I was almost tempted to use 
a blessed scroll of genocide on them.  Does "confused" enchant weapon repair rust
damage?

Mazes are BORING.  The number of maze levels can be easily cut down to 4 or 5 easily
without affecting the character of the game.

Here's what I think is a "minimum" of equipment (realistically) needed to ascend:
- Armor (gdsm is nice)
- Named Weapon
- RoC  (this is one of the most powerful items in the game, IMHO)
- RoL  (comes in very handy)
- PYEC (to recharge those wands of wishing, death and digging) + warning etc.

And ...drumroll... the blessed spoiler file!

Me thinks I've rambled enough.

-Chakra.

